HERO VIDEO TEST BLOCK - AUTHORING EXAMPLE

This document shows how to properly author the hero-video-test block in document-based AEM.

STRUCTURE:
The block must be created as a 2-column table with the block name in the first row.

STEP-BY-STEP INSTRUCTIONS:

1. Insert a Table with 2 columns and 2 rows
2. In the first row, first cell, type: "Hero-video-test"
3. Leave the first row, second cell empty
4. In the second row, first cell, add your video content
5. In the second row, second cell, add your overlay content

EXAMPLE TABLE STRUCTURE:

┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    Hero-video-test                      │
├───────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────┤
│ [VIDEO CONTENT]          │ [OVERLAY CONTENT]           │
└───────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────┘

DETAILED EXAMPLE:

┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    Hero-video-test                      │
├───────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────┤
│ https://player.vimeo.com/ │ Neoprobe® Gamma Detection   │
│ video/1127342102          │ System                      │
│                           │                             │
│ [Image: hero-poster.jpg]  │ With over 20 years of       │
│                           │ excellence, the Neoprobe®   │
│ [Image: placeholder.jpg]  │ GDS is dependable, simple,  │
│                           │ and accurate. 1,2            │
│                           │                             │
│                           │ **Learn More**              │
│                           │ https://player.vimeo.com/   │
│                           │ video/1127342102            │
└───────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────┘

COLUMN 1 - VIDEO CONTENT:
- First element: Vimeo URL (required)
- Optional: Poster image
- Optional: Placeholder image

COLUMN 2 - OVERLAY CONTENT:
- Heading text
- Description text
- Call-to-action button with Vimeo URL

IMPORTANT NOTES:
- Both Vimeo URLs must be valid (contain video IDs)
- The block name must be exactly "Hero-video-test"
- Use a 2x2 table structure
- The "Learn More" link should be formatted as a button (bold text)

VALID VIMEO URL FORMATS:
✅ https://player.vimeo.com/video/1127342102
✅ https://vimeo.com/1127342102
✅ https://vimeo.com/video/1127342102

INVALID FORMATS:
❌ YouTube URLs
❌ Direct MP4 files
❌ Invalid Vimeo URLs

TROUBLESHOOTING:
If the console shows "No overlay section found":
1. Ensure you're using a 2-column table
2. Check that the block name is "Hero-video-test"
3. Verify both columns have content
4. Make sure Vimeo URLs are valid
